OL,3,ALindsay Clancy murder case ends without
OL,4,Averdict as judge declares a mistrial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe judge in the trial of Lindsay
OL,7,FClancy - the US mother accused of
OL,8,Fmurdering her three children - has
OL,9,Fofficially declared a mistrial
OL,11,FThat means the trial has collapsed
OL,12,Fwithout a verdict - court will
OL,13,Freconvene at the end of the month to
OL,14,Fdecide what happens next
OL,16,FThe decision follows a last-ditch
OL,17,Fappeal from the defence after the jury
OL,18,Fsaid earlier that "with a heavy heart"
OL,19,Fthey were "unable to come to a
OL,20,Funanimous decision"
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
