OL,3,ALindsay Clancy murder case ends without
OL,4,Averdict as judge declares a mistrial
OL,5,
OL,6,FClancy, 36, is charged with three
OL,7,Fcounts of first-degree murder in the
OL,8,Fdeaths of her three children - Cora, 5,
OL,9,FDawson, 3, and eight-month-old Callan -
OL,10,Fat their Massachusetts home in 2023
OL,12,FShe does not deny killing them, but her
OL,13,Flawyer argues she was suffering from
OL,14,Fpostpartum psychosis, and could not
OL,15,Fdistinguish right from wrong
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
